	<p>
		Hello! My name is Arthur and I'm an aspiring graphic designer who is extremely interested in logo
		and brand design!
	</p>

	<p>
		I have designed brands for mltiple different purpouses including my own brand. The other brands
		I've designed for are the Coalition for University Equity (CUE) and LGBTQIAmes, both are local
		groups based in the Ames aria. For each of them I did a full design package including logos,
		colors, font selection, pattern design, and a full brand manual for them to refference as needed.
	</p>

	<p>
		<img> [Branding Examples](public/Branding-Examples.png) </Img>
	</p>

	<p>
		If you decide to work with me, you can expect a fully personalized experience with frequent
		updates and communication. I can design from scratch or help with rebranding. If you don't
		require a full brand package, you can still pick from a wide range of services including
		individual branding assets like a logo or pattern design. All available options and their prices
		can be found on the "Services" page.
	</p>

